"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>F1.1 One object, three readings — desk</title>\n<script src=\"./support.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<x-dc>\n<helmet>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&amp;family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500;6..72,600&amp;display=swap\">\n<style>\nbody{margin:0;background:#F3EDE3;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1E1A15}\na{color:#2F4470}a:hover{color:#1C2B4A}\nbutton{font-family:inherit}\n</style>\n</helmet>\n<div style=\"width: 1440px; height: 900px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: #F3EDE3; color: #1E1A15; font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;\">\n\n  <header style=\"height: 56px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCD3C4; background: #FBF8F2;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; width: 260px;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6154; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;\">Module F1</span>\n",
"      <span style=\"font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\">Histories of making</span>\n    </div>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Module path\" style=\"flex-grow: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #574E42; white-space: nowrap;\">Unit 1 of 37</span>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 3px; align-items: center;\">\n        <sc-for list=\"{{units}}\" as=\"t\" hint-placeholder-count=\"37\">\n          <span style=\"display: block; width: 12px; height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: {{t.bg}};\"></span>\n        </sc-for>\n      </div>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6154; white-space: nowrap;\">Thread: Attribution · level 1</span>\n    </nav>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center;\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 13px; padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid #DCD3C4; border-radius: 999px; color: #574E42;\">Route: Maker</span>\n      <span style=\"font-size: 13px; padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid #DCD3C4; border-radius: 999px; color: #574E42;\">Orientation</span>\n",
"      <button type=\"button\" style=\"height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border: 1px solid #DCD3C4; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1A15;\">Glossary</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" style=\"height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border: 1px solid {{accent}}; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1A15;\">Sources record · 1</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div style=\"flex-grow: 1; display: flex; min-height: 0;\">\n\n    <section aria-label=\"Atlas\" style=\"width: 960px; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; background: #EAE2D5; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center;\">\n          <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" style=\"height: 40px; padding: 0 14px; border: 0; border-radius: 9px; background: #1E1A15; color: #FBF8F2; font-size: 13px;\">Node card</button>\n          <div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Atlas surfaces\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 4px; background: #FBF8F2; border: 1px solid #DCD3C4; border-radius: 10px; padding: 4px;\">\n",
"            <button type=\"button\" style=\"height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; border: 0; border-radius: 7px; background: transparent; color: #574E42; font-size: 13px;\">Place</button>\n            <button type=\"button\" style=\"height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; border: 0; border-radius: 7px; background: transparent; color: #574E42; font-size: 13px;\">Time</button>\n            <button type=\"button\" style=\"height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; border: 0; border-radius: 7px; background: transparent; color: #574E42; font-size: 13px;\">Connections</button>\n            <button type=\"button\" style=\"height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; border: 0; border-radius: 7px; background: transparent; color: #574E42; font-size: 13px;\">Groupings</button>\n          </div>\n          <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; border: 1px dashed #8C8173; border-radius: 999px; background: transparent; color: #574E42; font-size: 12px;\">Story layer</button>\n        </div>\n        <div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Lenses\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;\">\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6154;\">Lenses</span>\n",
"          <button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" style=\"height: 30px; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid #2F4470; border-radius: 999px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #2F4470; font-size: 12px;\">Labour and credit</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" style=\"height: 30px; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid #DCD3C4; border-radius: 999px; background: transparent; color: #574E42; font-size: 12px;\">Material</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" style=\"height: 30px; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid #DCD3C4; border-radius: 999px; background: transparent; color: #574E42; font-size: 12px;\">Provenance</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" style=\"height: 30px; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid #DCD3C4; border-radius: 999px; background: transparent; color: #574E42; font-size: 12px;\">More</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"flex-grow: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative;\">\n        <figure style=\"margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; align-items: center;\">\n",
"          <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image placeholder: proto-cuneiform tablet with seal impressions\" style=\"width: 520px; height: 390px; border-radius: 6px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, #D8CDB9 0 10px, #D2C6B0 10px 20px); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 1px 0 #C9BCA4;\">\n            <span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #574E42; background: #FBF8F2; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px;\">[Object image — Met Open Access, CC0]</span>\n            <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 96px; top: 118px; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1E1A15; color: #FBF8F2; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">1</span>\n            <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 330px; top: 250px; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1E1A15; color: #FBF8F2; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">2</span>\n",
"            <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 400px; top: 88px; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1E1A15; color: #FBF8F2; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">3</span>\n          </div>\n          <figcaption style=\"width: 520px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #574E42;\">\n            <span style=\"font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif; font-size: 16px; color: #1E1A15;\">Proto-cuneiform tablet with seal impressions</span><br>\n            about 3100–2900 BCE · probably Uruk, Mesopotamia · The Metropolitan Museum of Art, 1988.433.1 · Public domain\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <button type=\"button\" style=\"position: absolute; right: 20px; bottom: 16px; height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border: 1px solid #DCD3C4; border-radius: 8px; background: #FBF8F2; color: #1E1A15; font-size: 13px;\">What was happening elsewhere</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div aria-label=\"Time scrubber\" style=\"padding: 14px 20px 18px; border-top: 1px solid #DCD3C4; background: #F3EDE3; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\">\n        <div style=\"position: relative; height: 22px;\">\n",
"          <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 10px; height: 2px; background: #C9BCA4;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 34px; width: 22px; top: 5px; height: 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: {{accent}}; opacity: 0.85;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 24px; width: 42px; top: 5px; height: 12px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px dashed {{accent}};\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; color: #6B6154;\">\n          <span>3500 BCE</span><span>2000 BCE</span><span>500 BCE</span><span>1000 CE</span><span>2000 CE</span>\n        </div>\n        <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #574E42;\">Range shown: about 3100–2900 BCE · soft ends mark uncertainty</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-label=\"Unit\" style=\"width: 480px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FBF8F2; border-left: 1px solid #DCD3C4; padding: 24px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #6B6154; letter-spacing: 0.03em;\">F1.1 · ORIENTATION · ABOUT 12 MIN · OPENS ON THE OBJECT</div>\n",
"      <h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 500;\">One object, three readings</h1>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #3A332B;\">You read it before anyone told you about it. Here is how your three readings compare with the record.</p>\n\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid #DCD3C4;\">\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCD3C4; font-size: 13px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">1 · Material</span>\n          <span style=\"color: #6B6154;\">You: “stone, carved”</span>\n          <span>Record: clay <span style=\"display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #574E42; border-bottom: 2px solid #574E42; width: fit-content;\">documented</span></span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCD3C4; font-size: 13px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">2 · Labour</span>\n",
"          <span style=\"color: #6B6154;\">You: “a scribe for a king”</span>\n          <span>No maker is named; a seal shows a figure, dogs and boars <span style=\"display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #574E42; border-bottom: 2px solid #574E42; width: fit-content;\">documented</span></span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCD3C4; font-size: 13px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">3 · Meaning</span>\n          <span style=\"color: #6B6154;\">You: “a law, or a prayer”</span>\n          <span>An account of barley distribution <span style=\"display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #574E42; border-bottom: 2px solid #574E42; width: fit-content;\">documented</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 14px; background: #F3EDE3; border-radius: 10px;\">\n",
"        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2F4470; color: #FBF8F2; font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif; font-size: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">H</span>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #2F4470;\">Historian</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\">Two of your three readings changed. What made you expect stone and a prayer — and what would you look for first next time?</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n        <div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Lane\" style=\"display: flex; gap: 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid #DCD3C4;\">\n          <button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"{{isMaker}}\" style=\"height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border: 0; border-bottom: {{makerLine}}; background: transparent; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1A15;\">Maker</button>\n",
"          <button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"{{isBriefer}}\" style=\"height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border: 0; border-bottom: {{brieferLine}}; background: transparent; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1A15;\">Briefer</button>\n        </div>\n        <sc-if value=\"{{isMaker}}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{true}}\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\">Read an object you own the same way: photograph it, then write one line for each reading before you look anything up.</p>\n        </sc-if>\n        <sc-if value=\"{{isBriefer}}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{false}}\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\">Write the attribution line you would put in a deck, then check it against the record.</p>\n        </sc-if>\n        <div style=\"padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid #DCD3C4; border-radius: 8px; background: #FFFFFF; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #3A332B;\">\n          <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 11.5px; color: #6B6154; margin-bottom: 4px;\">ATTRIBUTION LINE · GENERATED FROM THE RECORD</span>\n",
"          Proto-cuneiform tablet with seal impressions, about 3100–2900 BCE, probably Uruk, Mesopotamia. Maker not named. The Metropolitan Museum of Art, 1988.433.1. Public domain.\n          <span style=\"display: block; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 12px; color: #574E42;\">Provenance: Erlenmeyer collection, bought 1943 to the early 1960s; sold at Christie's, London, 1988. How it left Iraq is not recorded. <span style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #574E42;\">documented</span></span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\">\n          <button type=\"button\" style=\"height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: {{accent}}; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;\">Start with my object</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" style=\"height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border: 1px solid #DCD3C4; border-radius: 8px; background: #FFFFFF; color: #1E1A15; font-size: 14px;\">Add line to sources record</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <a href=\"#\" style=\"margin-top: auto; font-size: 14px;\">Next · F1.2 The reference-to-appropriation spectrum</a>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</x-dc>\n",
"<script type=\"text/x-dc\" data-dc-script data-props='{\"accent\":{\"editor\":\"color\",\"default\":\"#A0431F\",\"options\":[\"#A0431F\",\"#2F4470\",\"#5B6B2E\",\"#7A4B8C\"]},\"lane\":{\"editor\":\"enum\",\"options\":[\"Maker\",\"Briefer\"],\"default\":\"Maker\"},\"$preview\":{\"width\":1440,\"height\":900}}'>\nclass Component extends DCLogic {\n  renderVals() {\n    const accent = this.props.accent ?? '#A0431F';\n    const lane = this.props.lane ?? 'Maker';\n    const units = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < 37; i++) {\n      units.push({ bg: i === 0 ? accent : '#D2C6B0' });\n    }\n    return {\n      accent,\n      units,\n      isMaker: lane === 'Maker',\n      isBriefer: lane === 'Briefer',\n      makerLine: lane === 'Maker' ? '2px solid ' + accent : '2px solid transparent',\n      brieferLine: lane === 'Briefer' ? '2px solid ' + accent : '2px solid transparent'\n    };\n  }\n}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
